Half a Beat (慢半拍) — Silhouette Rhythm (Lemo-Opuscar) · LemoLab × Claude Opus 5.5

No AI-generated images, no photographs, no stock footage. Every silhouette, the sky, the water and every
ripple and droplet are drawn in code (film.js, shapes.js, sky.js).

